"Usage: mqtt_subscriber [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --uauthority <UAUTHORITY>\n          Authority for the local subscriber identity [default: authority-a]\n      --uentity <UENTITY>\n          UEntity ID for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x15678]\n      --uversion <UVERSION>\n          UEntity major version for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --resource <RESOURCE>\n          Resource ID for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1234]\n      --source-authority <SOURCE_AUTHORITY>\n          Source authority filter for publish subscription [default: authority-b]\n      --source-uentity <SOURCE_UENTITY>\n          Source UEntity ID filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x13039]\n      --source-uversion <SOURCE_UVERSION>\n          Source UEntity major version filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --source-resource <SOURCE_RESOURCE>\n          Source resource ID filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x8001]\n      --broker-uri <BROKER_URI>\n          MQTT broker URI in host:port format [default: localhost:1883]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n"
